      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784523100340,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Web Crawler\nA web crawler is a program that automatically traverses the web by downloading web pages and following links from one page to another.\nIt is used to index the web for search engines, collect data for research, or monitor websites for changes.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Web Crawler\nA web crawler is a program that automatically traverses the web by downloading web pages and following links from one page to another.\nIt is used to index the web for search engines, collect data for research, or monitor websites for changes.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Ox5nN04j3DRAdtxgDNy7P",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -57371.691348830376,
      "y": -6525.511736616398,
      "width": 874.4594116210938,
      "height": 550,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1230531288,
      "version": 972,
      "versionNonce": 1968099544,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784523587947,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements\n- Crawl the web starting from a given set of seed URLs\n- Extract text and store in DB\n\n------------ Below the line --------------\n- The actual processing of text data(eg. training LLM)\n- Handling non-text data(eg. images, vidoes, gif etc)\n- Handling of dynamic content(eg. java-script rendered pages)\n- Handling auth\n\n\n\nNon-functional Requiements\n- Fault tolerance to handle failure gracefully and resume crawling without loosing progress\n- Politeness to adhere to robots.txt and not overload website servers\n- Scale to 10B pages\n- Efficient to crawl in 5 days\n\n------------ Below the line ------------\n- Security to protect against malicious actors\n- cost to operate system within budget\n- compliance to adhere to legal and privacy regulations",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements\n- Crawl the web starting from a given set of seed URLs\n- Extract text and store in DB\n\n------------ Below the line --------------\n- The actual processing of text data(eg. training LLM)\n- Handling non-text data(eg. images, vidoes, gif etc)\n- Handling of dynamic content(eg. java-script rendered pages)\n- Handling auth\n\n\n\nNon-functional Requiements\n- Fault tolerance to handle failure gracefully and resume crawling without loosing progress\n- Politeness to adhere to robots.txt and not overload website servers\n- Scale to 10B pages\n- Efficient to crawl in 5 days\n\n------------ Below the line ------------\n- Security to protect against malicious actors\n- cost to operate system within budget\n- compliance to adhere to legal and privacy regulations",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Uk8so7jaxbk6GYoNGsDK0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -57361.789443638954,
      "y": -5896.3500862598175,
      "width": 1227.819091796875,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
