      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784523733827,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "API or System Interface\n- Its not a customer facing product, its an infra design question so we define the data system receives and what it outputs\n    Input: Seed URLs to start crawling from.\n    Output: Text data extracted from web pages.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "API or System Interface\n- Its not a customer facing product, its an infra design question so we define the data system receives and what it outputs\n    Input: Seed URLs to start crawling from.\n    Output: Text data extracted from web pages.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "wZbJUgw1n2HHkSxpyqNC2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -57355.19472564049,
      "y": -5720.386105567736,
      "width": 886.33935546875,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2022197928,
      "version": 40,
      "versionNonce": 405882328,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784523792054,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Data Flow\n- Take seed URL from frontier queue and request IP from DNS\n- Fetch HTML from external server using IP\n- Extract text data from the HTML.\n- Store the text data in a database.\n- Extract any linked URLs from the web pages and add them to the list of URLs to crawl.\n- Repeat steps 1-5 until all URLs have been crawled.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Data Flow\n- Take seed URL from frontier queue and request IP from DNS\n- Fetch HTML from external server using IP\n- Extract text data from the HTML.\n- Store the text data in a database.\n- Extract any linked URLs from the web pages and add them to the list of URLs to crawl.\n- Repeat steps 1-5 until all URLs have been crawled.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "i2hyUsBR0rpozK88VZulI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -57749.1706343298,
      "y": -5390.826957765676,
      "width": 1539.249755859375,
      "height": 203.73920238546816,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 863499480,
      "version": 575,
      "versionNonce": 1004462504,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784524147655,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Notes\n- Frontier Queue : Its the queue of URLs we need to crawl, initially populated with seed URLs and we add new URLs to it as we crawl.\n    Kafka, Redis or SQS\n- Crawler - Our server that does the fetching, extraction text and urls \n- DNS - resolves domain names to IP\n- Use S3 or Google Cloud Storage or Azure Blob Storage\n- Ask interviewer if seed URL is provided? if not discuss few strategies to come up with them",
      "fontSize": 23.284480272624933,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Notes\n- Frontier Queue : Its the queue of URLs we need to crawl, initially populated with seed URLs and we add new URLs to it as we crawl.\n    Kafka, Redis or SQS\n- Crawler - Our server that does the fetching, extraction text and urls \n- DNS - resolves domain names to IP\n- Use S3 or Google Cloud Storage or Azure Blob Storage\n- Ask interviewer if seed URL is provided? if not discuss few strategies to come up with them",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "VehB3jVq--xC55JPo4t3v",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -55963.29482800846,
      "y": -6287.103183382267,
      "width": 168.6502617613945,
      "height": 38.895385137599995,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
